flowchart TB
  U[Users] --> CDN[CDN + WAF]
  CDN --> GW[API gateway]
  GW --> LB[L7 LB - WebSocket]
  LB --> RT1[Realtime pod] & RT2[Realtime pod] & RTN[Realtime pod ... KEDA on sockets]
  RT1 & RT2 & RTN --> RC[(Redis Cluster - regional)]
  RT1 & RT2 & RTN --> K{{Kafka / Redis Streams}}
  K --> MED[Media workers - queue depth] & ANA[Analytics] & MOD[Moderation]
  RT1 & RT2 & RTN --> PG[(Managed Postgres)]
  RT1 & RT2 & RTN --> CH[(Cassandra / Scylla - chat)]
  MED --> S3[(S3 / R2 - HLS segments)]
  CDN --> S3
